{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29502b4889e7ea6899e63c2d8b163689f36780763bd6318bb6f6e55cd917e19b", "ja": "お疲れさま。\nみんな集まって、何を楽しそうに話してるんだ？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n你们聚在这聊得这么开心，是什么话题啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "064df3b7df059d562d37bcc7bc43ec1745dc599ffa02f61ae101a13604434972", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん♪　ふふっ、\nお捜しする前に来てくださるなんて、さすがですね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生♪\n呵呵，我们正想去找你，你就出现了，真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fe4f92a02f160906f317e842a803dd6529aed7718fc40855a5ed002104e2c408", "ja": "えっ、俺を捜すって……？", "zh": "咦，找我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "aa81df3a12f622e17c3e3c459641ccce9ecbf47c17d5198de3c9181b76957171", "ja": "今度、新しくみんなで歌う曲があるって\n聞いたんですけど。それって、本当なんですか？", "zh": "我们听说下次大家要一起唱新歌，\n这是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8492657571465ae9fc73bd639ddc27efaa2f4783d37171227520d03f05855c36", "ja": "ああ、今度の全体公演の曲のことかな。", "zh": "嗯，你们说的应该是下次全体公演的歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d9b3af11dd861036273cefb1cc42cdb17d7fd642e4fa554e503c59e664898993", "ja": "それなら本当だよ。\nちょうど今、曲が上がってきたところだ。", "zh": "那是真的喔，\n正好歌才刚完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "b5bd72bbd052b7855cd39d28dcc67a871e5a144298c8b360830666c4652684a5", "ja": "全体公演……それじゃあ、みんなで歌うんですね！", "zh": "全体公演……这么说，大家要一起唱歌呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "652dae57d076313f1ff37bd1b682a29667c42e607dc1c8f3e72f58581d6a6b37", "ja": "わたし、聞きたいです！", "zh": "我想听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "7d3a3dbfdf606f30b0a2fb3720a04c0e30e03d5614020892b618c8dd7eae3fd9", "ja": "あっ、いいな♪　{$P$}さん、\n私達にも、聞かせてください！", "zh": "哇，好棒喔♪{$P$}先生，\n请让我们也听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f6bfa34e5c30c9f7e32a4636f16c131414d4c9755931457716473ab79d8ecf38", "ja": "わかった、わかったから……。\nそれじゃ少しだけ、聞いてみようか。", "zh": "好好好，我知道了……\n那就稍微听一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1010_se", "source_sha256": "172a52394be90cca6467e0a57d29eba5541a0b314af596f3855f7d00b40d23ab", "ja": "パタン", "zh": "磅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "17211d1762ab1d9ab8a4e19a4136fb7d475f334236377495e98e74ad069fd649", "ja": "お疲れさまです……まあ、みなさんお揃いで。\n何かあったのですか？", "zh": "辛苦了……哎呀，大家都聚在这里。\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "67ddb9657b89480e56e9317d66ebeb09673ad4f73d70d96a346d542be89775c2", "ja": "紬さん！\nはい、とってもいいことがあったんですよ！", "zh": "小䌷姊姊！\n是啊，有个天大的好消息喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5e625cce47a2aa49a4f06f51fb2478b30c342c05c9d607dbfd434b0f534be2d9", "ja": "今から、みんなで歌う新曲を試聴するところなんだ。\n紬も聞いていくか？", "zh": "我们正要试听大家一起合唱的新歌。\n䌷也要一起听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "55583ce0d9bf32ca33ca6584126284fb8c0b27cabdc850b8bc6cd891f5eaef5f", "ja": "わざわざ確かめるということは、\nまさか私が断ることを期待して……？", "zh": "你刻意询问我的意愿，\n莫非是希望我拒绝……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ac757e3390b244ddd6ce0a7983611a2d1e3a35c22012f5abe438fe84d5fc2513", "ja": "ち、違う違う、用事でもあったらと思って。\nそれじゃ、とにかく聞いてくれ。", "zh": "不、不是啦，我是想说你可能有事要忙。\n那就一起听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "0d9377663c64a52949f195124885589daa8b715dfa5194638fb034848d0f4e79", "ja": "わぁ……！\n素敵な曲ですね……！", "zh": "哇……！\n好棒的歌……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "12966b83a169e92f520c549dc8ec717d41d929493660be1d68ea1e0d9f347ece", "ja": "これが、私達の曲……ですか……。", "zh": "这就是……我们的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "4104c2ce957f9d08deb51dd65eb7f338096cfdece36a7aa955a682596fb30ac7", "ja": "ふふっ、そうなんだって。\n私達みーんなの曲だよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n是我们大家的歌喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "a54b517115b4e5136125d9ee61a228059c63b53918509e1d8215b9ac6469ffca", "ja": "一度聞いただけで、みんな笑顔になって……。\n本当に素敵な曲ですね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "才听第一次，大家脸上就都露出了笑容……\n这首歌真的很棒呢，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2a408fc45582e282571fcb2944ddfaf1020ae714a2d323e47a39b9242db8064f", "ja": "そうか。俺もいい曲だと思ったけど、みんなにも\n気に入ってもらえたみたいで、よかったよ。", "zh": "我也觉得这首歌很不错，\n看来大家都很喜欢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "0f45afefcfe4269e3a1e3757b57afb94332a1e96f9603ebd8a631873cadae23a", "ja": "この曲をお客さんに聞いてもらうの、\nとっても楽しみですね！", "zh": "好期待让观众听到这首歌喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4e57a18f0ff7f5db30fd87191f10b1d30aea1f31349c1e12432063cd012b41ac", "ja": "私達、みんなの曲……みんなの……。", "zh": "我们、大家的歌……大家的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0d365003af0c1b254e7a7cd451a1c6ef5dcdf67fd5f0017ea4e2fd384654badd", "ja": "（劇場のアイドルみんなで歌う曲。\nこの手応えなら、公演も盛り上がりそうだ！）", "zh": "（这是剧场所有偶像将一同演唱的歌曲。\n从她们的反应看来，公演气氛应该会非常热烈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_010_synopsis", "source_sha256": "73d2ac417356673f51613f3e324dbb7776474428674c7b374baf450636c4d039", "ja": "次の公演は劇場のみんなで作る全体公演！\n自分たち自身の手で最高の公演にしようと、\nアイドル達は大はりきり。時に脱線しながら\nも自主的に準備を進め、見事に公演を成功さ\nせて、また新たな目標に向かっていく。", "zh": "下次的公演为剧场全员亲手打造的全体公演！\n偶像们都卯足干劲，要亲手打造最棒的公演。\n虽然她们偶尔会搞错方向，仍积极主动筹备，\n让公演顺利成功，并再次朝新的目标迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
